{
  "_about": "Held-out validation pool for the actuation-lever GRADUATION BAR. NEVER tune the bar thresholds to make these pass -- the bar is consulted only to EVALUATE a threshold change. Each case stores PER-RUN ROW SETS (not a hand-fabricated tally); the test feeds them through the REAL rule_tally + graduation_verdict end-to-end, so a case can only assert a verdict the producer can actually emit (closes the fabricated-n_pairs hole, audit wf_24ad4f0c-092). Rows: lane + influenced_by (treatment carries the rule id, baseline does not) + the metric value. The default bar is min_runs=3, min_pairs=6, min_improving_frac=0.75, drc effect floor 2.0; effect gated on the MEDIAN per-run delta.",
